  "body": "1. In chrome Dev and Canary, as below. Serial device added is normal.\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/12728472/145686729-eed25e14-b25b-4d41-aae8-ef026ac953bf.png)\r\n\r\n2. However, in general chrome, serial device is not added.\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/12728472/145686747-11ffd63c-17c9-4592-88e5-a8f261d89104.png)\r\n\r\n3. In general, I enabled the enable-experimental-web-platform-features option.\r\n\r\nIs serial device added not automatically added in regular chrome yet?\r\n\r\nWe confirmed that dev, canary, and general are all enabled as USB. Only serial is missing.\r\n\r\nIs there any setting I'm missing?",
